{
  "_id": "wp-post-8977",
  "_type": "post",
  "_createdAt": "2026-02-10T06:44:06Z",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-10-06T22:13:51Z",
  "title": "Form I-20: Your Essential Guide to Studying in the USA",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "form-i-20-your-essential-guide-to-studying-in-the-usa"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-07-25T06:11:56",
  "excerpt": "Planning to pursue your academic dreams in the United States? The Form I-20 is one of the most critical documents [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "5bcca2af2b28",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "557271ad7ce8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Planning to pursue your academic dreams in the United States? The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9226e6a63ea1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Form I-20"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e49dd09c66d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is one of the most critical documents you’ll encounter. Often referred to as the “Certificate of Eligibility for Nonimmigrant Student Status,” this guide provides a comprehensive overview of everything international students need to know about the I-20, from application to travel."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f61040d52b35",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a23e9f088fc5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What is Form I-20? "
        },
        {
          "_key": "33615c6a95a8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0d5b9000d18f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "418e9ad5f708",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Foundation of Your US Student Journey"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "22c6500cc96c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "90b708fcc0db",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3c2b03ef95b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Form I-20"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0192d1ab90d3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is a formal document issued by a U.S. educational institution that is certified by the Student and Exchange Visitor Program (SEVP). It serves as official proof that:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c535a228d397",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "371ae2d5d078",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You’ve been accepted for full-time study at a SEVP-approved school."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8ff528eb2bde",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "096c3254c469",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You meet the necessary academic requirements for your chosen program."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "98f17c237292",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "41f32fa60281",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You have demonstrated sufficient financial resources to cover your tuition and living expenses throughout your stay."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "48dc5a1abcd3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8a4b6f9b63ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This document is absolutely mandatory for securing an "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0f40192665d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "F-1 student visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d121a75d6748",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (for academic and language programs) or an "
        },
        {
          "_key": "465db1086dbb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "M-1 student visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f540cdfd8cf3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (for vocational programs)."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d20dd569f56d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f9d02564e2fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Who Needs a Form I-20?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "13fe48694b23",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bba4bf36c712",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you’re an aspiring international student aiming for an F-1 or M-1 visa, you "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f1b90811f25f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "must"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f54b10a6264b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " obtain a Form I-20. This requirement also extends to any eligible dependents (spouse or minor children) accompanying you; each dependent will require their own individual I-20 form."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d09e253debf4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8f65d009985a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Eligibility for Form I-20: Are You Qualified?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4d1032b9223a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "086ceed2b23f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To get your hands on an I-20, you generally need to meet these key criteria:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9fa0408e8b6c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3b0518327fe7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Acceptance by an SEVP-Certified School:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d15b33f6ca97",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your chosen college, university, or vocational school must be approved by SEVP to enroll international students."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ff53cd918125",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "030b002c63f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Demonstrated Financial Ability:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00fa74c6c96f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You must prove you have adequate funds to cover all your educational and living costs. This includes tuition, fees, housing, food, and other personal expenses."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e8e693cc3c26",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "edd31aa81637",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Academic Qualification:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8d0b1b64b39a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You need to fulfill the specific admission requirements of your program and institution."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f698ce4b1a20",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ab339e07a1c7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Full-Time Enrollment:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4847e2147b20",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You must be admitted into a full-time academic or vocational course of study."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1b384b718cbc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a601db77df34",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to Get Your Form I-20: Step-by-Step Application Process"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "758ff72c9ed9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "16ae4538dc30",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The journey to obtaining your I-20 typically involves these crucial steps:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a2c87119b0ea",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4583e997ef8a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Gain Admission to an SEVP-Certified School:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e781fb342ce6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This is your primary objective. Apply to and receive an official acceptance letter from a U.S. institution."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "db0d88b40f56",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "77ef57adb8bf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Submit Required Documents to Your School:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ca9d58136f77",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Once accepted, your school’s Designated School Official (DSO) will request specific documents to generate your I-20. Common requirements include:\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8281f2a41f60",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "15e43d066e45",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "777d830563fa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A clear copy of your passport’s biographical page."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "133dc1cd4b82",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4ecbde47071f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Proof of Financial Funding:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e321954d3be6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This is paramount. Provide recent bank statements, sponsor affidavits, scholarship letters, or other official financial documents that meet the school’s estimated cost of attendance."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "aabe6e977321",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "85829db309d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sponsor’s Affidavit of Support (if a family member or other individual is funding your education)."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f0055d91c47a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4e377dd286ff",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Academic transcripts, diplomas, and standardized test scores (e.g., TOEFL, IELTS, SAT, GRE, GMAT), which you likely submitted during your admission application."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6df77d7bb594",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5d6018f2251c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "School Issues Form I-20:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "42be33f89eff",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " After verifying your documents, your DSO will create your student record in the Student and Exchange Visitor Information System (SEVIS) and issue your official Form I-20."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ab6059f705df",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9cadffd04300",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Sign Your Form I-20:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "125e6ea5ec7b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Both you and your DSO must sign the Form I-20. If you are under 18, your parents or legal guardians must also sign. While digital I-20s are increasingly accepted, having a physical copy for your visa interview and entry is highly recommended."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "aa0842dea33c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2954f1c4684c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Understanding Your Form I-20: Key Information Points"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b3a93221e8af",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "84849e193066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Your Form I-20 contains vital data that you’ll refer to repeatedly:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "75d4c2ab3f47",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a2dd871aef4e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "SEVIS ID Number:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ffd3f43a0e85",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A unique identifier that links your record to the SEVIS database."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d2697d80d4cc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f747583a441d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Personal Information:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7abf5872ef10",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your full name, date of birth, country of birth, and citizenship."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3732b66baba2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8e70753617b1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Program Details:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9a5a96425f01",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The name of your academic program, start date, estimated end date, and educational level."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7d19cd81326b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a832b498faa0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Estimated Cost of Attendance:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c81956a89819",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A detailed breakdown of tuition, fees, living expenses, and other costs."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d7146526e7f4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "356e8acc5e0f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Sources of Funding:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "771563392736",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Information on how you plan to finance your studies."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1340d033219d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5fa1d9846c6b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "School Information:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0d037b13d8e7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Name, address, and SEVP certification details of your institution."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "48881972ffda",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5c5c238d8376",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Signatures:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7fcfe0aee099",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your signature and the signature of the Designated School Official (DSO)."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2a88d1071f96",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "544315982792",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Form I-20 vs. F-1 Visa: What’s the Difference?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e439d4f76487",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d7ddad788c10",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It’s crucial not to confuse these two essential documents:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "af62b49ba484",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3a20a702644a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Form I-20:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "43ec5e48ae29",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This is your "
        },
        {
          "_key": "686f3ab03beb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "Certificate of Eligibility"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ae27e9aec9d2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", issued by your U.S. school. It confirms your acceptance and eligibility to study."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "715f0ca9400d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "21ef0e5daf69",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "F-1 Visa:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "82d555d302e3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This is a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "394181ffdc5b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "visa stamp"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4e733c9f126c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " placed in your passport by a U.S. Embassy or Consulate. It permits you to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b0d854dc256c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "apply for entry"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ea2ba315ec86",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " into the United States as a student."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7b81fe0da97c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "72efaf9974a3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0e5754b5da17",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "must have your Form I-20"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f178d5ba9ca5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " before you can apply for your F-1 visa."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c45e35837da6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "440441d3c447",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Role of SEVIS and the I-901 SEVIS Fee"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6f13828626d6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d63231a54a46",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "SEVIS (Student and Exchange Visitor Information System):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "67fd52dcc916",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This is the U.S. government’s online system that tracks international students and exchange visitors. Your DSO uses SEVIS to manage your I-20 record."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ed0fedf94949",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2561d5f70fa7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "I-901 SEVIS Fee:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5e0f71cf9cb5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A mandatory fee (currently $350 for F-1 students, subject to change) that you must pay to the U.S. government "
        },
        {
          "_key": "93e091e2fa11",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "after"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6800c65345fa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " receiving your I-20 and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "6c7cfb298b84",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "before"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b737104a56b1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " your visa interview or entry into the U.S. Your SEVIS ID from your I-20 is required for this payment. Keep the receipt!"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
