          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Maintaining Status:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "648d16d264fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your I-20 remains valid as long as you are continuously enrolled full-time and comply with all U.S. immigration regulations."
